OL,3,CGary McKee runs from John o'Groats to
OL,4,CLands End in just 30 days
OL,6,FCumbrian fundraiser Gary McKee MBE has
OL,7,Fcompleted his latest challenge - a 900-
OL,8,Fmile run from John o'Groats to Land's
OL,9,FEnd in just 30 days.
OL,11,FGary crossed the finish line in
OL,12,FCornwall on Tuesday evening (11
OL,13,FAugust), having set off from John
OL,14,Fo'Groats on 13 July leading a team
OL,15,Fraising funds and awareness for The
OL,16,FLicensed Trade Charity, which supports
OL,17,Fhospitality workers.
OL,19,FOver the course of 30 days, the team
OL,20,Fbattled intense heat, demanding
OL,21,Fterrain and the physical challenge
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/7
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
