OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1786745064
OL,3,CGary McKee runs from John o'Groats to
OL,4,CLands End in just 30 days
OL,6,Fof covering an average of 30 miles
OL,7,Fevery day as they made their way from
OL,8,Fthe northern tip of Scotland to
OL,10,Fthe south-west coast of England.
OL,12,FAlong the route, Gary and the team
OL,13,Fvisited and received support from
OL,14,Fpubs, bars, hospitality workers and
OL,15,Fmembers of the public.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/7
