PN,32803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1786745064
OL,3,CGary McKee runs from John o'Groats to
OL,4,CLands End in just 30 days
OL,6,FFor Cleator Moor resident McKee, the
OL,7,Flatest feat comes just months after he
OL,8,Fcompleted his 100toLDN challenge, in
OL,9,Fwhich he ran 100 marathons in 100
OL,10,Fconsecutive days before finishing at
OL,11,Fthe 2026 London Marathon alongside his
OL,12,F18-year-old son, Beau.
OL,14,FThe 56-year-old is no stranger to
OL,15,Fextreme endurance challenges, running
OL,16,Fa marathon every day for the entirety
OL,17,Fof 2022, raising just shy of #1.4
OL,18,Fmillion for charity.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/7
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,329,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1786745064
OL,3,CGary McKee runs from John o'Groats to
OL,4,CLands End in just 30 days
OL,6,FMcKee was awarded an MBE in the 2026
OL,7,FNew Year Honours in recognition of his
OL,8,Ffundraising efforts.
OL,10,FSpeaking at the finish line in
OL,11,FCornwall, he said: "I'm immensely
OL,12,Fproud to cross the finish line, having
OL,13,FtakenJon this challenge and covered
OL,14,Fthe miles with such wonderful people
OL,15,Falong the way.
OL,17,F"Over 30 days and 900 miles, every
OL,18,Fstep was powered by the warmth,
OL,19,Fgenerosity, and resilience of the
OL,20,Fhospitality community.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G4/7
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,329,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1786745064
OL,3,CGary McKee runs from John o'Groats to
OL,4,CLands End in just 30 days
OL,6,F"From the local pub teams cheering us
OL,7,Fon in the baking heat to the tens of
OL,8,Fthousands joining us virtually, the
OL,9,Fsupport across the country has been
OL,10,Fnothing short of humbling."
OL,12,FJoby Mortimer, Director of Charity
OL,13,FOperations at the Licensed Trade
OL,14,FCharity, said: "Yesterday was an
OL,15,Fincredibly emotional moment for
OL,16,Feveryone involved.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G5/7
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
