PN,32806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1786745064
OL,3,CGary McKee runs from John o'Groats to
OL,4,CLands End in just 30 days
OL,6,F"Thirty days ago, we set out from John
OL,7,Fo'Groats with an ambitious goal to
OL,8,Fcover this huge distance in aid of
OL,9,Fraising vital funds and awareness for
OL,10,Fthe critical work we do for
OL,11,Fhospitality people in need.
OL,13,F"To stand at Land's End having brought
OL,14,Ftogether thousands of people from
OL,15,Facross the industry and seenJsuch
OL,16,Foverwhelming support for the cause is
OL,17,Ftruly remarkable."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G6/7
